{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37769","headline":"春夕伴同年礼部赵员外省直 · 郑谷","name":"春夕伴同年礼部赵员外省直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦帐名郎重锦科，清宵寓直纵吟哦。\n冰含玉镜春寒在，粉傅仙闱月色多。\n视草即应归属望，握兰知道暂经过。\n流莺百啭和残漏，犹把芳樽藉露莎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}